THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This package vendors third-party source under deps/. Their licenses are
reproduced in full alongside the code and are summarised here.

1. libmagic  --  BSD-2-Clause
   Path:    deps/libmagic
   License: deps/libmagic/COPYING
   Copyright (c) Ian F. Darwin 1986-1995; maintained 1994- Christos Zoulas.
   Compiled into the addon on every platform.

2. libgnurx (GNU C Library regex port)  --  LGPL-2.1-or-later
   Path:    deps/libmagic/msvc/libgnurx-2.5
   License: deps/libmagic/msvc/libgnurx-2.5/COPYING.LIB
   Copyright (C) 2002, 2003, 2005 Free Software Foundation, Inc.

   *** This is the only copyleft component in the package. ***

   It supplies POSIX regex, which the Microsoft C runtime does not provide.
   It is therefore compiled ONLY into the Windows binaries -- win32-x64,
   win32-ia32 and win32-arm64. The macOS and Linux binaries use the system
   regex and contain no LGPL code whatsoever.

   LGPL-2.1 section 6 requires that a user linking this library statically
   be able to relink the work with a modified version of it. This package
   satisfies that: the complete, unmodified libgnurx source ships in the
   npm tarball together with the addon source (src/), the rest of libmagic
   (deps/) and the build definition (binding.gyp), so the Windows binary
   can be rebuilt from source against a modified libgnurx with:

       npm rebuild @vishalkumar14/mmmagic

   No part of this package has been modified from upstream libgnurx.
